: "1534668664815229", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828608_1534668668148562_2847273100927791941_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zY2GSO0HWr4Q7kNvwGEaZ18&_nc_oc=AdrdioYgMh5PY1hpXwhJcGGABst-PH3eHbywL-kiIlzKHUQC4biRaLDQiNN7owVtfU4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOwW1TT1hmF-hwAKf2drZ6paMwisBxByLl9DSwHM5flpw&oe=6AC6457E"}, {"file_name": "Virtual Labs Placement Valve-dl.png", "id": "1750184185984965", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824292_1750184189318298_620395110789289113_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4P-6qb1P8EQQ7kNvwFpL_xE&_nc_oc=AdqRFUUDCkmi2CYiT9j21AerbI7DDZQn6IAaUZNb4b3o_qoy8gLXcFKYNx8s17jTqsA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPxIVFBPm_jdgixpPbd9Quhs5H6QicRvM2r5VRUbGB5GA&oe=6AC65789"}, {"file_name": "Virtual Labs Connect Cylinder-dl.png", "id": "1495295735198043", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823341_1495295738531376_1861062275351574466_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=54soCAgmA8YQ7kNvwHosEOV&_nc_oc=AdqAUDtopbFNo77i8J_PKdcAaRbzbknQQkFhCAYEV6qjJkGKu3f1uVkUcTDfMs3-CB0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPtfPq7Zsn1jJdt1vll9a6OF-bMfpqRqHqYMbpZtsZtaA&oe=6AC65B40"}, {"file_name": "Virtual Labs Exciting Air-dl.png", "id": "3135597933304482", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825345_3135597943304481_1078580948447945149_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qFoAM_ftmw4Q7kNvwGSE2_d&_nc_oc=Ados3HUemYbUL2_z-vbFt29Xp5fACjnnXYAw3gaz7x0LeyfVQLxexB02yneYhnvAs0I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNEjzxYGm_Ltazj2ZUvzPSlyNOVCV55ffER_ztq_G5Eug&oe=6AC64488"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail.png", "id": "1032377493129046", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823296_1032377496462379_6801999949835867097_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GLXQiwLY-AQQ7kNvwGbD0Ci&_nc_oc=AdqiKk8hYXQ9xQB1dHKgsPyTHsVO5VW5YN-Lk4UD_ZHY8ZL5xXqAi2MVvseiTmqKTgU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMfnllnqurQ6GC-Kyofe57vAHxgYr2I-b_KwFcYgrGGmw&oe=6AC6572C"}, "display_name": "Festo Virtual Labs", "keywords": ["Education", "Training", "Festo", "Learning"], "long_description": "**Experience automation and mechatronics like never before with our XR-powered simulation.**\n\nBy using virtual automation components in a real-world environment, you can see what used to be impossible. Interact with valves, cylinders, tubes, manifolds and other components to understand their functions and how they work together in an integrated system.\nWith the connection to our FluidSIM simulation & interaction software we guarantee real-time simulation results for in-depth analysis and troubleshooting.\nAs a bonus, see how a mechatronic system is used in a real-world industrial environment, gaining valuable insights into practical applications.", "short_description": "Discover the future of technical education with Festo Didactic. Immerse yourself in an interactive learning world where you can experience pneumatics, hydraulics and electrics up close. Simulate your own circuits and push the boundaries of what's possible. Use innovative real-world application examples to apply your knowledge in real-world examples and prepare yourself optimally for the challenges of the real world."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1355601079346360", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Festo Virtual Labs", "keywords": ["Festo", "LX", "Lernen", "Training", "Pneumatik"], "long_description": "**Erleben Sie Automatisierung und Mechatronik wie nie zuvor mit unserer XR\u2011gest\u00fctzten Simulation.**\n\nDurch den Einsatz virtueller Automatisierungskomponenten in einer realen Umgebung sehen Sie, was zuvor unm\u00f6glich war. Interagieren Sie mit Ventilen, Zylindern, Schl\u00e4uchen, Verteilerbl\u00f6cken und anderen Komponenten, um ihre Funktionen zu verstehen und wie sie in einem integrierten System zusammenwirken.\nDank der Anbindung an unsere FluidSIM\u2011Simulations\u2011 und Interaktionssoftware liefern wir Echtzeit\u2011Simulationsergebnisse f\u00fcr detaillierte Analysen und Fehlersuche.\nAls zus\u00e4tzlicher Vorteil sehen Sie, wie ein mechatronisches System in einer realen Industrieumgebung eingesetzt wird und gewinnen wertvolle Einblicke in praktische Anwendungen.", "short_description": "Entdecken Sie die Zukunft der technischen Bildung mit Festo Didactic. Tauchen Sie ein in eine interaktive Lernwelt, in der Sie Pneumatik, Hydraulik und Elektrik hautnah erleben. Simulieren Sie Ihre eigenen Schaltungen und \u00fcberschreiten Sie die Grenzen des M\u00f6glichen. Nutzen Sie innovative Anwendungsbeispiele aus der Praxis, um Ihr Wissen in Beispielen aus der Praxis anzuwenden und sich optimal auf die Herausforderungen der realen Welt vorzubereiten."}]}, "developer_name": "Festo Didactic SE", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://lxdev.festo.com/en/imprint-and-data-privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://lxdev.festo.com/en/terms-of-use", "publisher_name": "Festo Didactic SE", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://festo.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "de", "fr", "es"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING", "SIT